didus\">CANDIDO</span><span data-text=\"proconsule\" data-n=\"85\" data-lemma=\"proconsul\">PROCONSULE</span><span data-text=\"et\" data-n=\"90\" data-lemma=\"et\">ET</span><span data-text=\"Lucio\" data-n=\"95\" data-lemma=\"Lucius\">LUCIO</span><span data-text=\"Cornelio\" data-n=\"105\" data-lemma=\"Cornelius\">CORNELIO</span><span data-text=\"Marcello\" data-n=\"110\" data-lemma=\"Marcellus\">MARCELLO</span> &nbsp;&nbsp; <span data-text=\"quaestore\" data-n=\"120\" data-lemma=\"quaestor\">QUAESTORE</span> &nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; <span data-text=\"pro\" data-n=\"130\" data-lemma=\"pro\">PRO</span> &nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; <span data-text=\"praetore\" data-n=\"140\" data-lemma=\"praetor\">PRAETORE</span> &nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span></div><p class=\"miniapp\"></p></div></div>  <div id=\"facsimile-images\"><h2>Facsimile Images</h2><a href=\"ISic000473_tiled.tif\"><img title=\"Photo M. Metcalfe\" src=\"ISic000473_tiled-thumb.tif\"></a><a href=\"ISic000473.jpg\"><img title=\"Photo M. Metcalfe\" src=\"ISic000473-thumb.jpg\"></a><a href=\"ISic000473_copy2_tiled.tif\"><img title=\"Photo J. Prag, courtesy Museo Regionale Archeologico Pietro Griffo\" src=\"ISic000473_copy2_tiled-thumb.tif\"></a><a href=\"ISic000473_copy2.jpg\"><img title=\"Photo J. Prag, courtesy Museo Regionale Archeologico Pietro Griffo\" src=\"ISic000473_copy2-thumb.jpg\"></a><a href=\"ISic000473_leftthreequarter.tif\"><img title=\"Photo J. Prag, courtesy Museo Regionale Archeologico Pietro Griffo\" src=\"ISic000473_leftthreequarter-thumb.tif\"></a><a href=\"ISic000473_leftthreequarter.jpg\"><img title=\"Photo J. Prag, courtesy Museo Regionale Archeologico Pietro Griffo\" src=\"ISic000473_leftthreequarter-thumb.jpg\"></a></div>  <div id=\"apparatus\"><h4>Apparatus criticus</h4><ul><li><span>  <span>Text based on autopsy</span>  </span></li></ul></div>  <div id=\"translation\"><h2>English translation</h2><p class=\"translation-author\"><a href=\"http://orcid.org/0000-0003-3819-8537\">Jonathan Prag</a></p>  <p>Sacred to the Concordia of the Agrigentines; the republic of the Lilybaetani (set this up); Marcus Haterius Candidus proconsul and Lucius Cornelius Marcellus quaestor pro praetore joined them in dedicating (it).</p>  </div>  <div id=\"translation\"><h2>Italian translation</h2><p class=\"translation-author\">  </p><p>Consacrato alla Concordia degli Agrigentini, la città di Lilibeo: dedicanti Marco Aterio Candido proconsole e Lucio Cornelio Marcello questore propretore</p>  </div>  <div id=\"commentary\"><h2>commentary</h2>  <p>  </p>  </div>  <div id=\"bibliography\"><h2>bibliography</h2>  <ul><li> 6767 <a href=\"https://biblio.inscriptiones.org/epig10000352\" target=\"_blank\">https://biblio.inscriptiones.org/epig10000352</a>  </li><li> Gualtherus 1624 [1625] 115 <a href=\"https://biblio.inscriptiones.org/epig10001931\" target=\"_blank\">https://biblio.inscriptiones.org/epig10001931</a>  </li><li> Mommsen 1883 <a href=\"http://arachne.uni-koeln.de/item/buchseite/650772\" target=\"_blank\">7192</a>  <a href=\"https://biblio.inscriptiones.org/epig10000589\" target=\"_blank\">https://biblio.inscriptiones.org/epig10000589</a>  </li><li> Salmeri 1984 <a href=\"https://biblio.inscriptiones.org/epig10001608\" target=\"_blank\">https://biblio.inscriptiones.org/epig10001608</a>  </li><li> Manganaro 1988 19 tav.1, 54, 68 n.349 <a href=\"https://biblio.inscriptiones.org/epig10001427\" target=\"_blank\">https://biblio.inscriptiones.org/epig10001427</a>  </li><li> Wilson 1990 180 fig.151 <a href=\"https://biblio.inscriptiones.org/epig10001509\" target=\"_blank\">https://biblio.inscriptiones.org/epig10001509</a>  </li><li> Manganaro 1998 137 n.28 <a href=\"https://biblio.inscriptiones.org/epig10001816\" target=\"_blank\">https://biblio.inscriptiones.org/epig10001816</a>  </li></ul>  <ul><li></li></ul>  </div>  <div id=\"handnote\"> <p>Tall, slightly curved letters, mostly with minimal serifs. P is open; R is closed with long tail; E has short horizontals of equal length, slightly upward curving; M is four equal slanting strokes. In line 5 the O and C of 'procos' are intelinked, and the following O is small and mid-line. A large diagonal upward stroke is visible above the first letter of each of the civic ethnics; and a horizontal above the Q at the end of line 6. The letters all show traces of dark paint (modern?).</p> Line 1  65-71  Line 2  68-74  Line 3  70-74  Line 4  72-75  Line 5  67-72  Line 6  67-74  Line 7  74-78  Interlineation line 1 to 2  50-52  Interlineation line 2 to 3  47-51  Interlineation line 3 to 4  50-52  Interlineation line 4 to 5  50-53  Interlineation line 5 to 6  52-55  Interlineation line 6 to 7  45-52  </div><div id=\"license\"> Licensed under a Creative Commons-Attribution 4.0 licence.  </div>",
